{"entryId":"1457","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1457:1","sourceSha256":"d6f224c258006df03975bcd97518cbe0e635c037cb9a8177fe793d1a470c9cbc","englishSha256":"73b4f2a90cf03428092713576b6f7963571fbf96f51c3b655aa74f375447223f","citations":[{"id":"1457:1:citation-01","he":[45,61],"en":[71,82],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Yevamot_40a.24"},"reference":"Yevamot 40a:24","assessment":"The parallel has Kara before Yannai expressly ruling as R. Yehudah and being sent outside to recite.","evidence":[{"reference":"Yevamot 40a:24","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Yevamot_40a.24"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1457:1:citation-02","he":[122,136],"en":[193,203],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Taanit_27b.12"},"reference":"Taanit 27b:12","assessment":"The verse division account adds a qualification for children learning to read. Heilprin quotes an abridgment.","evidence":[{"reference":"Taanit 27b:12","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Taanit_27b.12"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1457:1:citation-03","he":[137,151],"en":[205,217],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Megillah_22a.6"},"reference":"Megillah 22a:6","assessment":"The independent parallel likewise gives the schoolchildren exception. Its sage’s name is printed Chananya Kara in this witness.","evidence":[{"reference":"Megillah 22a:6","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Megillah_22a.6"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1457:1:citation-04","he":[13,44],"en":[17,29],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_30b.2"},"reference":"Berakhot 30b:2","assessment":"Checked 39b in full. The exact named sitting and Yannai’s rejection occur at 30b, preserving the received folio in the revised English.","evidence":[{"reference":"Berakhot 30b:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_30b.2"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"i